{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["וְחַיְתוֹ אֶרֶץ — like לְמַעְינוֹ מַיִם, בְּנוּ בָּעוֹר: yod and vav are extra." "וַיְהִי כֵן — that is: so it was for all time."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {0 "Rashbam cites instances of what he considers superfluous vav and yod to show that the vav in וְחַיְתוֹ is similarly extra; the two examples are from Judges 15:19 and Ezekiel 27:19."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T23:17:26.489885989Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}